  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconciliation in East Jerusalem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Partner ID is to assess the feasibility and context for a potential project focused on reconciliation between Jewish and Palestinian youth in East Jerusalem. The study will identify key challenges, actors, and opportunities for collaboration, particularly in the areas of dialogue and mutual understanding. It will also help determine the suitability of local partner organizations and provide insights on how to engage the target group effectively. The target group will primarily consist of young adults aged 20-30, with a focus on university students or those in higher education, who are crucial to shaping future generations&#xfffd; perspectives on peace and coexistence.</narrative>
  </description>
